llow to mix 3 type weapons at the same time\n* Random pick up color cell to upgrade specify weapon power\n* Option to pick up desire weapon instead of automatic switch weapon\n* Allow to create Black Hole \n* Features branching routes in stages 3 and 5\n* Branches trigger after boss fight. Left side = A; Right side = B\n\n[h1]  🔊         TESTER MUST KNOW:[/h1]\n* Rebind control keys by pressing left and right\n* Player have no shield at all = 1 hit will end a life\n* Touching enemy will consider ending life\n* Score will reset when player use the continue credit\n* Medals = The red winged gems fall from destroyed enemies\n* Black Hole = Neutralize enemy bullets + Damaging enemies\n* Completion is about 30+ min long campaign mission\n\n[h1]  ⚠️        RUMOR CHECKING:[/h1]\n* The Black Hole is a iconic feature ➜ It is interesting combination, but is hard to activate\n* It is a good arcade game ➜ Agree\n* Bullet visibility is a legitimate problem ➜ Agree\n* You need to memorize some enemy patterns ➜ Agree\n* Difficult to react to without memorizing the stages ➜ Agree\n\n[quote]\n[b]Remember  to 👍 for me if you liked this review:[/b]\n🔔 More similar reviews ➜ [u][url=http://store.steampowered.com/curator/31940448-Expectation-Checklist/]Browse Here[/url][/u] and follow this Curator, or\n🤝 Visit Our Gaming Discussion ➜ [u] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/expectationchecklist]We're Here[/url][/u]\n📢 Disclaimer regarding Short Hours & English Errors ➜ [u][url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/expectationchecklist/discussions/0/4594180031254224809/]Read Here[/url][/u]\n[/quote]",
